<i>Either way,</i>
<i>they should not lead you on like that.</i>

1162
00:54:54.500 --> 00:54:57.125
<i>-I've got it covered. Don't worry.</i>
<i>-Why are you so chill about this?</i>

1163
00:54:57.208 --> 00:54:59.666
<i>I just realized I have to go.</i>
<i>I'll see you later.</i>

1164
00:54:59.750 --> 00:55:01.791
<i>Bye. Oh, you know what?</i>

1165
00:55:02.666 --> 00:55:04.250
<i>My gynecologist is a Dukie.</i>

1166
00:55:04.666 --> 00:55:05.625
<i>Jake Taylor?</i>

1167
00:55:05.708 --> 00:55:06.833
<i>It's definitely him.</i>

1168
00:55:06.916 --> 00:55:07.750
<i>So hot.</i>

1169
00:55:07.833 --> 00:55:08.958
<i>Great.</i>

1170
00:55:09.041 --> 00:55:11.458
<i>So Jas is dancing</i>
<i>to Jake Taylor's choreography.</i>

1171
00:55:11.541 --> 00:55:13.791
<i>God, this is exactly what I needed today.</i>

1172
00:55:13.875 --> 00:55:16.000
<i>[Brit] What happened</i>
<i>with your Juilliard audition?</i>

1173
00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:19.791
<i>Oh, I don't know, Britney. </i>
<i>Why don't you mind your damn business?</i>

1174
00:55:20.291 --> 00:55:25.250
<i>Sorry, it's just that they said</i>
<i>conservatory dancing is different,</i>

1175
00:55:25.333 --> 00:55:28.750
<i>and if I want to be taken seriously,</i>

1176
00:55:28.833 --> 00:55:31.750
<i>I would need to learn to control my fire.</i>

1177
00:55:31.833 --> 00:55:32.916
<i>[Brit] Oh, it's okay.</i>

1178
00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:34.750
<i>[sobbing]</i>

1179
00:55:34.833 --> 00:55:35.875
<i>[Brit] I'm so sorry.</i>

1180
00:55:36.583 --> 00:55:39.208
<i>Wait. What? Don't be sorry for me.</i>
<i>Be sorry for them.</i>

1181
00:55:39.833 --> 00:55:43.500
<i>Yeah, I would die before I extinguish</i>
<i>my flames for some stuffy-ass school.</i>

1182
00:55:43.583 --> 00:55:45.875
<i>You don't want this?</i>
<i>You don't want that?</i>

1183
00:55:46.416 --> 00:55:48.958
<i>You don't want this fire?</i>
<i>Your loss.</i>

1184
00:55:49.041 --> 00:55:49.958
<i>Their loss.</i>

1185
00:55:50.041 --> 00:55:52.750
<i>You know who else didn't go</i>
<i>to Juilliard? Cardi B.</i>

1186
00:55:54.000 --> 00:55:58.375
<i>Bruno Mars, Jamiroquai, Janelle Monáe,</i>
<i>Janet Jackson, Oprah, Obama.</i>

1187
00:55:58.791 --> 00:55:59.666
<i>Lots of people.</i>

1188
00:56:00.750 --> 00:56:01.625
<i>So I'm fine.</i>

1189
00:56:06.750 --> 00:56:08.500
<i>Do we still call him Juilliard?</i>

1190
00:56:09.958 --> 00:56:11.791
<i>[woman]</i>
<i>Quinn, you can do better than this.</i>

1191
00:56:16.166 --> 00:56:17.000
<i>[Jas] Dude!</i>

1192
00:56:17.666 --> 00:56:18.791
<i>Robby can flip!</i>

1193
00:56:18.875 --> 00:56:20.583
<i>-[mouths word]</i>
<i>-[Jas] He flipped!</i>

1194
00:56:21.708 --> 00:56:23.083
<i>[all] Yeah! [laughing]</i>

1195
00:56:23.166 --> 00:56:25.291
<i>Robby! Whoo! [laughing]</i>

1196
00:56:25.375 --> 00:56:26.416
<i>[Jas] Come on! Come on!</i>

1197
00:56:27.291 --> 00:56:29.333
<i>[Juilliard] All right.</i>
<i>Now that we've saged the space,</i>

1198
00:56:29.416 --> 00:56:31.541
<i>let's try to adjust</i>
<i>this terrible lighting.</i>

1199
00:56:31.625 --> 00:56:34.458
<i>Brit, Trinity, can you help me</i>
<i>find the switches, please?</i>

1200
00:56:39.125 --> 00:56:40.250
<i>Where's Jake?</i>

1201
00:56:41.958 --> 00:56:42.958
<i>[door closes]</i>

1202
00:56:44.666 --> 00:56:45.958
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

1203
00:56:46.041 --> 00:56:47.875
<i>-We booked the studio.</i>
<i>-[Quinn] What?</i>

1204
00:56:47.958 --> 00:56:51.083
<i>You know you have to actually pay</i>
<i>to use a dance studio, right?</i>

1205
00:56:51.541 --> 00:56:53.125
<i>Otherwise, people get fired.</i>

1206
00:56:57.916 --> 00:56:58.916
<i>Jake!</i>

1207
00:57:00.250 --> 00:57:01.541
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

1208
00:57:01.625 --> 00:57:04.166
<i>-Jake, everything's gonna be okay.</i>
<i>-How?</i>

1209
00:57:05.750 --> 00:57:07.250
<i>How is it gonna be okay?</i>

1210
00:57:08.333 --> 00:57:09.916
<i>Quinn, I just got fired.</i>

1211
00:57:10.000 --> 00:57:12.625
<i>I need this job.</i>
<i>How am I gonna pay my rent?</i>

1212
00:57:18.291 --> 00:57:19.333
<i>Shit.</i>

1213
00:57:20.000 --> 00:57:22.958
<i>Is that how you want to play this,</i>
<i>you little psychopath?</i>

1214
00:57:23.458 --> 00:57:27.500
<i>[chuckles] Your outburst is really eating</i>
<i>into our rehearsal time, sweetie.</i>

1215
00:57:27.583 --> 00:57:31.416
<i>You seriously felt so threatened by us</i>
<i>that you had to sabotage our team?</i>

1216
00:57:31.500 --> 00:57:33.625
<i>I didn't do anything.</i>
<i>You do that all on your own.</i>

1217
00:57:34.083 --> 00:57:37.041
<i>See, I still remember</i>
<i>when we were freshmen,</i>

1218
00:57:37.583 --> 00:57:39.458
<i>and you didn't make the Birds.</i>

1219
00:57:39.916 --> 00:57:41.041
<i>But you begged,</i>

1220
00:57:41.875 --> 00:57:45.833
<i>and you did the seniors' homework</i>
<i>and washed their cars.</i>

1221
00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:50.833
<i>Flank me. Flank me, flank me.</i>

1222
00:57:51.458 --> 00:57:55.125
<i>You know, a lot's changed, Jas.</i>
<i>Now everyone washes my car.</i>

1223
00:57:55.208 --> 00:57:56.958
<i>It's so clean, you could eat sushi off it.</i>

1224
00:57:57.041 --> 00:57:57.875
<i>I did it once.</i>

1225
00:57:58.375 --> 00:58:01.833
<i>Well, enjoy your poke off your Prius</i>
<i>while you can.</i>

1226
00:58:01.916 --> 00:58:02.916
<i>This is not over.</i>

1227
00:58:03.791 --> 00:58:05.708
<i>And you look like a tampon commercial.</i>

1228
00:58:05.791 --> 00:58:06.625
<i>Let's go.</i>

1229
00:58:11.625 --> 00:58:13.708
<i>[Jas] Oh, ho, it's on now.</i>

1230
00:58:13.791 --> 00:58:16.208
<i>-Oh, we're taking him down.</i>
<i>-[Tapes] Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.</i>

1231
00:58:16.291 --> 00:58:17.375
<i>[Priya] Oh yes.</i>

1232
00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:18.833
<i>Hey.</i>

1233
00:58:19.625 --> 00:58:20.625
<i>Where's Jake?</i>

1234
00:58:22.041 --> 00:58:22.875
<i>[door shuts]</i>

1235
00:58:28.125 --> 00:58:31.958
<i>[Quinn] </i>Over the next few days,
I reached out to Jake a bunch of times,

1236
00:58:32.041 --> 00:58:35.291
<i>and I waited for him to text me back,</i>
<i>but he never did.</i>

1237
00:58:36.125 --> 00:58:40.000
<i>Meanwhile, all the time I had put</i>
<i>into the dance team had wrecked my GPA.</i>

1238
00:58:41.708 --> 00:58:44.208
<i>And that's when I got the e-mail.</i>

1239
00:58:46.125 --> 00:58:49.250
<i>"As of January 22nd,</i>
<i>I will no longer be working</i>

1240
00:58:49.333 --> 00:58:51.541
<i>in the Duke University</i>
<i>admissions department.</i>

1241
00:58:52.291 --> 00:58:56.125
<i>If this is in regards to an application,</i>
<i>please contact our office directly."</i>

1242
00:58:56.208 --> 00:58:57.041
<i>What?</i>

1243
00:58:58.500 --> 00:59:01.291
<i>[repeating] No.</i>

1244
00:59:02.291 --> 00:59:04.416
<i>[Ms. Ramirez] </i>-Hello?
<i>-Thank God. Hi!</i>

1245
00:59:04.500 --> 00:59:07.500
<i>Ms. Ramirez, it is-- It's Quinn Ackerman</i>
<i>from Woodbright High.</i>

1246
00:59:07.583 --> 00:59:09.583
<i>Uh, you probably don't remember me.</i>
<i>I'm the dancer.</i>

1247
00:59:09.666 --> 00:59:12.958
<i>Oh yeah, the illuminator.</i>
<i>How ya doin'? You keeping it lit?</i>

1248
00:59:13.041 --> 00:59:15.833
<i>Yeah. Um, so, I saw the e-mail</i>
<i>that you sent.</i>

1249
00:59:15.916 --> 00:59:18.041
<i>What's that about?</i>
<i>What's happening over there?</i>

1250
00:59:18.125 --> 00:59:20.916
<i>Yeah. I'll tell you</i>
<i>what's happening here… Nothing.</i>

1251
00:59:21.000 --> 00:59:23.916
<i>[Quinn] </i>What happened to…
shaking things up?

1252
00:59:24.000 --> 00:59:26.208
<i>Yeah. You know what?</i>
<i>They really weren't into that.</i>

1253
00:59:26.291 --> 00:59:27.625
<i>What can I say? I tried.</i>

1254
00:59:27.708 --> 00:59:28.625
<i>[Quinn] </i>You tried?

1255
00:59:28.708 --> 00:59:30.500
<i>I learned how to dance.</i>

1256
00:59:30.583 --> 00:59:32.625
<i>[Ms. Ramirez] </i>I'm sorry. Wait.
What did you say?

1257
00:59:32.708 --> 00:59:35.166
<i>I started a dance team for you.</i>

1258
00:59:35.250 --> 00:59:37.291
<i>Good for you, girl. You blew up the box.</i>

1259
00:59:37.375 --> 00:59:39.041
<i>No, I blew up my life.</i>

1260
00:59:39.125 --> 00:59:42.250
<i>You didn't blow up your life.</i>
<i>You blew up your box.</i>

1261
00:59:42.333 --> 00:59:43.333
<i>What does that mean?</i>

1262
00:59:44.833 --> 00:59:46.375
<i>-[guard clears throat]</i>
<i>-I gotta go.</i>

1263
00:59:46.458 --> 00:59:48.958
<i>-It's turning into a whole thing.</i>
<i>-</i>No, you don't have to--

1264
00:59:49.041 --> 00:59:49.958
<i>Hello?</i>

1265
00:59:51.083 --> 00:59:51.916
<i>No.</i>

1266
00:59:52.333 --> 00:59:54.291
<i>Shit! Shit!</i>

1267
00:59:59.208 --> 01:00:01.208
<i>[indistinct conversations]</i>

1268
01:00:02.041 --> 01:00:03.666
<i>[mom] A half-day suspension?</i>

1269
01:00:04.125 --> 01:00:05.458
<i>What if Duke finds out?</i>

1270
01:00:05.541 --> 01:00:08.208
<i>I know. I had a bad day,</i>
<i>and the dance team--</i>

1271
01:00:08.291 --> 01:00:11.583
<i>Ever since you started dancing,</i>
<i>you have been completely off-balance.</i>

1272
01:00:11.666 --> 01:00:14.333
<i>Your grades have been dropping.</i>
<i>You're home late. I...</i>

1273
01:00:16.125 --> 01:00:19.666
<i>I don't understand why you felt the need</i>
<i>to have this whole other hobby</i>

1274
01:00:19.750 --> 01:00:21.333
<i>that has nothing to do</i>

1275
01:00:21.416 --> 01:00:23.500
<i>with what we've been working towards</i>
<i>this whole time.</i>

1276
01:00:23.583 --> 01:00:24.458
<i>Mom, I lied to you.</i>

1277
01:00:24.541 --> 01:00:26.291
<i>-What?</i>
<i>-I lied because</i>

1278
01:00:26.375 --> 01:00:29.666
<i>the Duke interview</i>
<i>was not going as well as I said it was,</i>

1279
01:00:29.750 --> 01:00:32.041
<i>and the admissions lady</i>
<i>brought up the Thunderbirds,</i>

1280
01:00:32.125 --> 01:00:33.750
<i>so I made her think I was on the team…</i>

1281
01:00:33.875 --> 01:00:36.083
<i>-What are you talking about?</i>
<i>-…though I only do lighting.</i>

1282
01:00:36.166 --> 01:00:38.458
<i>So then Jas and I decided</i>
<i>to make our own team…</i>

1283
01:00:38.541 --> 01:00:39.958
<i>-Stop.</i>
<i>-…then today I found out</i>

1284
01:00:40.041 --> 01:00:41.875
<i>the admissions lady</i>
<i>doesn't work there anymore.</i>

1285
01:00:41.958 --> 01:00:45.208
<i>I don't understand.</i>
<i>So is it over? Is it done?</i>

1286
01:00:46.750 --> 01:00:48.916
<i>I still have another month</i>
<i>to resubmit my grades,</i>

1287
01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:50.083
<i>but they've gotten…</i>

1288
01:00:51.333 --> 01:00:54.000
<i>pretty bad, and the suspension is…</i>

1289
01:00:55.125 --> 01:00:55.958
<i>not good.</i>

1290
01:00:59.583 --> 01:01:00.958
<i>I'm really sorry, Mom.</i>

1291
01:01:02.125 --> 01:01:03.333
<i>Oh, man.</i>

1292
01:01:05.666 --> 01:01:06.666
<i>Okay.</i>

1293
01:01:08.625 --> 01:01:09.625
<i>It's okay.</i>

1294
01:01:10.625 --> 01:01:12.208
<i>We're gonna figure this out.</i>

1295
01:01:13.333 --> 01:01:15.625
<i>You're gonna buckle down</i>
<i>and focus on your school work,</i>

1296
01:01:15.708 --> 01:01:17.375
<i>and you're gonna pull those grades up.</i>

1297
01:01:22.875 --> 01:01:24.541
<i>You know what this means, though?</i>

1298
01:01:29.583 --> 01:01:31.958
<i>So you're just gonna quit on us?</i>
<i>Just like that?</i>

1299
01:01:32.416 --> 01:01:34.458
<i>I really need to get my grades up.</i>

1300
01:01:35.541 --> 01:01:39.083
<i>Plus, I'm the worst dancer on the team.</i>
<i>You guys don't really need me. And…</i>

1301
01:01:39.625 --> 01:01:42.250
<i>I'm holding you guys back.</i>
<i>I'm the weak link.</i>

1302
01:01:42.333 --> 01:01:43.458
<i>Yeah.</i>

1303
01:01:43.541 --> 01:01:44.791
<i>And we stuck by you.</i>

1304
01:01:46.625 --> 01:01:47.583
<i>Jas…</i>

1305
01:01:49.250 --> 01:01:51.500
<i>I did all of this for </i>you,<i> Quinn.</i>

1306
01:01:51.875 --> 01:01:54.791
<i>I quit the Birds for you.</i>
<i>You begged me to.</i>

1307
01:01:55.250 --> 01:01:58.791
<i>And what? Just 'cause your mom says</i>
<i>you have to, you're gonna bail on us?</i>

1308
01:01:59.458 --> 01:02:00.833
<i>I'm really sorry.</i>

1309
01:02:01.250 --> 01:02:02.083
<i>Wow.</i>

1310
01:02:03.250 --> 01:02:06.541
<i>For a second, I thought you cared,</i>
<i>and you weren't just using all of us.</i>

1311
01:02:06.625 --> 01:02:08.500
<i>I do care. I still care.</i>

1312
01:02:08.583 --> 01:02:11.416
<i>You know, I really hope</i>
<i>you get into Duke, Quinn.</i>

1313
01:02:12.291 --> 01:02:14.916
<i>And I hope it was worth</i>
<i>losing your only friend over.</i>

1314
01:02:15.958 --> 01:02:17.666
<i>Ja-- Jas?</i>

1315
01:02:18.583 --> 01:02:19.583
<i>Jas?</i>

1316
01:02:20.291 --> 01:02:21.291
<i>Jas!</i>

1317
01:02:22.791 --> 01:02:23.958
<i>Guys, wh--[exhales]</i>

1318
01:02:31.333 --> 01:02:32.375
<i>You don't hate me?</i>

1319
01:02:32.458 --> 01:02:35.666
<i>No, I do. I just need to update</i>
<i>my Instagram story.</i>

1320
01:02:36.625 --> 01:02:38.083
<i>Are you filming me right now?</i>

1321
01:02:38.916 --> 01:02:40.791
<i>You've been filming this whole time?</i>

1322
01:02:44.041 --> 01:02:44.958
<i>Stop that.</i>

1323
01:02:45.041 --> 01:02:46.166
<i>[sighs]</i>

1324
01:02:48.083 --> 01:02:49.500
<i>That's it. It's over.</i>

1325
01:02:50.208 --> 01:02:51.625
<i>Priya Singh, signing off.</i>

1326
01:02:54.541 --> 01:02:57.625
<i>Quinn, I saw Priya's Instagram.</i>
<i>You can't quit.</i>

1327
01:02:57.708 --> 01:02:59.916
<i>You can't ghost me</i>
<i>and then tell me what to do.</i>

1328
01:03:00.041 --> 01:03:02.041
<i>You're right. I was upset,</i>
<i>and that's no excuse,</i>

1329
01:03:02.125 --> 01:03:04.208
<i>but you have to listen.</i>
<i>Don't walk away from this.</i>

1330
01:03:04.291 --> 01:03:05.833
<i>They'll be better off without me, okay?</i>

1331
01:03:05.916 --> 01:03:08.041
<i>Everyone is counting on you.</i>
<i>You can't bail on them.</i>

1332
01:03:08.125 --> 01:03:10.083
<i>You're lecturing me about quitting?</i>

1333
01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:13.833
<i>Look...</i>

1334
01:03:14.666 --> 01:03:16.458
<i>I made a promise to my mom.</i>

1335
01:03:16.541 --> 01:03:18.375
<i>I don't have time for dance anymore.</i>

1336
01:03:18.875 --> 01:03:21.291
<i>And I-- I really don't have time</i>
<i>for a boyfriend.</i>

1337
01:03:23.083 --> 01:03:25.375
<i>["Lost Cause" by Hannah Georgas playing]</i>

1338
01:03:36.333 --> 01:03:38.000
<i>-[sighs]</i>
-♪ Don't even know ♪

1339
01:03:38.083 --> 01:03:40.416
<i>♪ Anymore where to begin ♪</i>

1340
01:03:41.583 --> 01:03:45.041
<i>♪ Don't even know anymore who's a friend ♪</i>

1341
01:03:46.166 --> 01:03:50.583
<i>♪ Running on a tread</i>
<i>that never ends all the time ♪</i>

1342
01:03:55.375 --> 01:03:59.000
<i>♪ Ideas come and then they disappear ♪</i>

1343
01:03:59.916 --> 01:04:03.291
<i>♪ Fear is gone</i>
<i>And then it's standing here ♪</i>

1344
01:04:04.583 --> 01:04:08.791
<i>♪ And all that mattered to me</i>
<i>isn't so clear anymore ♪</i>

1345
01:04:11.916 --> 01:04:18.208
<i>♪ I feel like I'm a lost cause ♪</i>

1346
01:04:21.083 --> 01:04:27.625
<i>♪ I feel like I'm a lost cause ♪</i>

1347
01:04:30.166 --> 01:04:33.583
<i>♪ I feel like I'm a lost cause ♪</i>

1348
01:04:43.291 --> 01:04:44.791
<i>-[music ends]</i>
<i>-[TV] </i>Still waiting?

1349
01:04:44.875 --> 01:04:49.416
<i>This show's garbage.</i>
<i>I like </i>Queer Eye.<i> I love </i>Queer Eye.

1350
01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:52.166
<i>It makes me cry every time.</i>
<i>I wish they'd come here.</i>

1351
01:04:52.250 --> 01:04:53.583
<i>Give me a makeover.</i>

1352
01:04:55.500 --> 01:04:56.958
<i>So what's all that, honey?</i>

1353
01:04:57.458 --> 01:05:00.166
<i>Um… it's just chemistry, biology.</i>

1354
01:05:00.250 --> 01:05:04.416
<i>You shouldn't be spending Friday night</i>
<i>in this funeral home reading textbooks.</i>

